## Open questions (with recommendations)
- **I Subprocessor** (blank): rec = `Operations`. Alternatives: `Application` / `N/A`. Why: Access is "Engineering" only and the AC note frames it as Claude Code for developers — internal dev tooling, not customer data flowing through Normain product. Flip to `Application` if Normain's product calls Anthropic API on customer data.
- **T Subscription type** (blank): rec = `Per user`. Alternatives: `Total` / `Not a subscription`. Why: Claude.ai Team plan is per-seat. AC note says Claude Code is on personal plans — so the Normain-billed seats are Team plan only.
- **U Number of users** (blank): rec = read live from claude.ai members page during the screenshot step.
- **V Cost per month** (blank): rec = read live from claude.ai billing. AC implies Normain pays for Team plan seats (separate from personal Claude Code subs).
- **W Invoice Currency** (blank): rec = `USD` (Anthropic bills USD by default). Confirm after V is known.
- **Y Contract Renewal Date** (blank): rec = `Monthly` (Claude.ai Team plan default is monthly rolling). Alternatives: `YYYY-MM-DD` if annual contract.
- **AA Admin permissions through role** (blank): rec = `Yes`. Alternatives: `No` / `Unknown`. Why: Claude.ai Team plan has Owner/Admin/Member roles — no anonymous admin accounts.
